...@../../_tools/theme
shape: sequence_diagram

user: 사용자 { class: person }
ui: Streamlit UI { class: ours }
openai: OpenAI API { class: ext }
research: 조사 에이전트 { class: ours }
tool: deep_research 도구 { class: ours }

user -> ui: 키·주제 입력
ui -> research: Runner.run(research_agent, topic)
research -> openai: 주제 + 지시문 + 도구 스키마
openai -> research: "tool_call deep_research(query, max_depth=3, time_limit=180, max_urls=10)"
research -> tool: "deep_research(query, max_depth=3, time_limit=180, max_urls=10)"
tool -> user: Deep research error
tool -> research: AttributeError -> success: False
research -> openai: 도구 오류 결과 전달
openai -> research: 초기 보고서(final_output)
research -> ui: initial_report
ui -> user: 1차 보고서 표시
